    {
      "type": "appStoreVersionLocalizations",
      "id": "7311b82f-a2d7-4248-abc7-1a365f69182a",
      "attributes": {
        "description": "One app for the whole match — from the coin toss to the final score.\n\niScoreboard is a scoreboard, a timer, and a full set of referee tools in a single package. Set it up in seconds, keep score with one tap, and put the scoreboard on the wall while everyone plays.\n\nSCORE EVERY GAME YOU ACTUALLY PLAY\n• 29 built-in scoring modes: badminton, tennis, table tennis, pickleball, padel, squash, basketball, 3x3, soccer, futsal, volleyball, boxing, archery and more\n• Billiards built properly — snooker, eight-ball and nine-ball chase\n• Cards and table games: UNO, plus a flexible multi-player counter you can point at any house rules\n• Generic two-sided and free-form counters for everything not on the list\n\nRULES THE WAY YOU PLAY THEM\nSet points per game, games to win, win-by-two and score caps before the first serve. Doubles support tracks serve rotation, so the right side is really the right side. Change a rule mid-season and the next match follows it.\n\nTIME AND OFFICIALS, BUILT IN\n• Chess, Go and checkers clocks, cube timers, stopwatch and pause\n• Coin toss, dice, whistle, yellow and red cards, random team splitting, fullscreen captions for the score\n\nSCOREBOARD ON THE BIG SCREEN\nCast the board and share a 6-digit code — friends on their phones follow the same match live, from anywhere in the venue or across town.\n\nEVERY MATCH ON RECORD\nScores are kept automatically. Open a match later for the score trend, the timeline of how it unfolded, and voice notes you recorded at the courtside. Track how far you've come across a whole season.\n\nMADE TO DISAPPEAR INTO THE GAME\nLarge, glanceable digits, tap feedback and spoken score callouts that follow your system language. The scoreboard itself runs offline — only casting and cloud sync reach the network. No account is needed to start a match, and the microphone is used only for the voice notes you choose to record.\n\nFREE TO PLAY, OPTIONAL MEMBERSHIP\nAdvanced statistics, exclusive themes, cloud sync, priority access to new features and the professional casting experience are part of iScoreboard Membership.\n\n\nTerms of Use: https://jifenqi.com/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://jifenqi.com/privacy\nApple Standard EULA: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
        "locale": "en-US",
